## 🔧 Контракти (обов'язково)

### Типи

```ts
type PlanSubtopic = {
  name: string;
  priority: "high" | "normal";
};

type PlanTopic = {
  name: string;
  priority: "high" | "normal";
  subtopics: PlanSubtopic[];
};

type PlanContent = {
  level: CEFRLevel;
  generatedAt: string;   // ISO 8601 timestamp
  topics: PlanTopic[];
};
```

### Функції

```ts
generatePlanContent(
  level: CEFRLevel,
  weakTopics: WeakTopic[]
): PlanContent

savePlan(userId: string, content: PlanContent): Promise<Plan>
```

`WeakTopic` — тип з задачі 20: `{ topic: string; level: CEFRLevel; errors: number; skippedCount: number }`.

### Формат відповіді 200

```json
{
  "plan": {
    "id": "...",
    "level": "B1",
    "content": {
      "level": "B1",
      "generatedAt": "2026-10-17T12:00:00.000Z",
      "topics": [
        {
          "name": "Present Perfect",
          "priority": "high",
          "subtopics": [
            { "name": "Present Perfect Simple", "priority": "high" },
            { "name": "Present Perfect Continuous", "priority": "high" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Past Simple",
          "priority": "normal",
          "subtopics": [
            { "name": "Affirmative", "priority": "normal" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "isActive": true
  }
}
```

